WEBVTT

00:00:01.190 --> 00:00:02.340
Chara-su!

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:05.290
Is everyone shugo-peppy
again today?

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:07.720
It's time to start Shugo
Chara Party!

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:10.690
With Pucchi Puchi and Dokki Doki,
it's chock full of anime!

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:12.580
Everyone's hearts:

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:13.450
Unlock!

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.120
My heart: Unlock!

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.350
Open up my heart!

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:30.490
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:33.920
We're going on forever!

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:38.190
There's nothing to fear!

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:45.300
Lately it feels like things have changed a bit...

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:51.500
And it's, well, kind of nice, you know?

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:55.690
Doesn't matter who you are, if you don't give up,

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:59.190
you'll fly farther than you did today.

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:02.840
Even if you cry a bunch, and get depressed,

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:05.660
the morning will still come! So!

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.910
Negative heart: Lock on!

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:12.800
You'll find the courage!

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:16.050
Hold your head high, going on!

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:19.780
Continue on to tomorrow!

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:22.970
Your heart: Unlock!

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:26.850
Open up your heart!

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:30.020
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:33.580
We're going on forever!

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:37.660
There's nothing to fear!

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:49.950
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:53.280
[Note: Literal Translations Above]

00:01:49.950 --> 00:01:52.240
"Pun Detective El!"

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:56.420
Pun Detective El here.

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:57.940
And her partner Il!

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:03.420
Today we'll have a special presentation
of one of the cases we've solved.

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:13.010
El Detective Agency

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:13.010
"We Love Puns"

00:02:10.850 --> 00:02:12.450
Detective El, come quick!

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:13.010
There's been a <i>crime</i>!

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:13.010
There's a case(jiken)!

00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:16.760
Just give me five more minutes, I haven't
solved the final problem yet.

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:17.840
You're out of <i>time</i>!

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:17.840
That's a test(shiken)!

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:19.120
Do not mix!

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:20.460
Naw, it'll be <i>fine</i>!

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:20.460
That's dangerous(kiken)!

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:22.440
This is the culprit's DNA!

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:23.940
It's inter-<i>twined</i>!

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:23.940
That's criminology(kasouken)!


00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:27.900
Are you a pun detective or a rhyme
detective?! Just come with me!

00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:27.900
Enough with the puns already,
just come with me!

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:28.960
Rhi-not?

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:28.960
Say please! (kuda sai[rhino])

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:32.120
Pun Detective El!

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:38.030
And he was so lively yesterday...

00:02:38.230 --> 00:02:39.990
Oh, <i>poor chap</i>!

00:02:38.230 --> 00:02:39.990
Oh, my husband... (danna-sama)!


00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:42.140
Oh, <i>pork chop</i>!

00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:42.140
Oh, Mr. chest of drawers(tansu-sama)!


00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:47.200
Poor chap, Rorschach, lalalalala!

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:47.200
Husband(danna-sama),
last summer(rasto sama-), lalalala-

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:48.310
Ahem!

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:50.360
Pun Detective El!

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:54.970
He became like this overnight.
What a <i>pity</i>.

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:54.970
He came to this pitiful(aware)
state sometime during last night.

00:02:56.390 --> 00:02:58.100
No time to be <i>tipsy</i>!

00:02:56.390 --> 00:02:58.100
That's an unstable(awawa) state!

00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:00.310
Become what you are!

00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:00.310
Ah, what a pleasant
smelling state!

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:02.040
Don't quote <i>Nietzsche</i>!


00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:02.040
That's smelling like
a toilette(toware)!

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:03.240
And no one's gonna get that!

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:04.540
A-hem!

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:11.560
There is significance to the fact
that Yoru is facing to the right.

00:03:12.050 --> 00:03:14.460
Could it be a <i>dying message</i>?

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:19.200
"I've gone out for a bit. Please zap
the curry in the refrigerator."

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:21.020
That's a <i>dining message</i>!

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:26.970
Curry

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:25.080
That's a <i>diving message</i>!

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:28.600
What the heck does him facing
right mean already?!

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:31.980
Clearly he is pointing
at the culprit.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:35.980
Facing <i>right</i>, facing <i>migi</i>,
facing <i>Miki</i>...

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:37.940
The culprit is you, Miki!

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:40.060
What? I didn't do anything!

00:03:40.060 --> 00:03:42.990
It's just a pun, but so convincing!

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:44.240
Don't be convinced!

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:47.020
And here I always thought
of you as my friend!

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:47.970
Et tu, Su?

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:52.310
What's going on?

00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:55.470
What games have you been playing
while I was asleep-nya?!

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:57.880
<i>You'ru</i> alive!

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:57.880
Yoru has resurrected(yomigaeta->yorugaeta)!


00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:59.060
Good one!

00:03:59.060 --> 00:03:59.980
Good!

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:01.170
Esprit!

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:02.640
You think?

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:04.570
Thank you very much.

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:06.240
This ain't sittin' right with me.

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:10.180
And that was Pun Detective El!

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:12.760
Never Again!
- The Translator

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:16.910
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia, Character
Transformations!

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:18.520
Our first transformation is...

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:21.070
Amulet Spade!

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:29.630
Amulet Spade is the form that Amu-chan takes
when she Character Transforms with Miki!

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:35.610
Her special technique is waving a baton to
make musical notes fly out, Prism Music!

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:40.670
Plus, flinging out rainbow colors with
a brush, Colorful Canvas!

00:04:41.390 --> 00:04:43.530
That's a lot of artistic techniques!

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:50.030
The second character transformation
we'll introduce is...

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:53.560
Amulet Diamond!

00:04:55.890 --> 00:05:00.290
Amulet Diamond is the form that Amu-chan takes
when she Character Transforms with Dia!

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:06.300
Her special technique is shooting star-shaped energy
that surrounds her opponent from her mic,

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:08.020
Shooting Star Shower!

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:09.820
It's all sparkly, don't
you think?

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:18.770
We'll keep doing these Shugo Chara
Encyclopedias each week!

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:21.040
Look forward to it!

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:26.830
Amulet Diamond's
On the Scene!

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:30.610
Diamond, where did you go
to get a present this time?

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:35.270
I went to see the voice actress for <i>that</i>
character in Shugo Chara!

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:36.490
Please, take a look!

00:05:38.180 --> 00:05:41.600
Today, she is recording
a character song here!

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:49.040
Wait, that singing voice...
Could it be?

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:53.150
How do you do? I'm Amulet
Diamond, Nanami!

00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:56.260
Nice to meet you.
I'm Itou Kanae and I play Hinamori Amu.

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:58.110
Itou-san!

00:05:58.110 --> 00:05:58.890
Yes?

00:05:58.890 --> 00:06:03.300
Say something to everyone watching
at home in Amu-chan's voice!

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:04.910
Sure thing!

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:09.260
"I'm Hinamori Amu! Is everyone
enjoying Shugo Chara Party?"

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:11.490
"Negative Heart: Lock On!"

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:12.880
"Open Heart!"

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:15.430
Wow! It's Amu-chan!

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:18.690
Diamond, don't forget
the important part!

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:20.080
Itou-san!

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:20.500
Yes?

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:21.970
Give me a present!

00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:22.510
Okay!

00:06:22.510 --> 00:06:26.490
If you can get the quiz right, then you'll get
a copy of the CD I'm recording today.

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:35.940
"Signed by Itou Kanae"

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:30.110
Shugo Chara Character
Song Collection 3!

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:33.960
It has songs by Amu-chan, Utau-chan,
plus the Shugo Bomber theme song!

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:35.940
Not only that, but it'll
be signed by Itou-san!

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:38.370
We'll do our best!

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:40.280
Then, here's the question:

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:46.060
I, Itou Kanae, actually play a character
other than Amu-chan.

00:06:46.060 --> 00:06:47.970
What character is it?

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:51.880
So, do you know?

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:54.000
She does sound similar...

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:57.170
So your answer is...

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:01.110
Ready, set...

00:07:01.110 --> 00:07:02.510
Dia!

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:06.400
The correct answer is... "Dia!"

00:07:08.180 --> 00:07:10.240
Yay! Good going,
that's correct!

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.280
We got the signed CD!

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:16.410
Entry information will be
at the end of the show!

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:16.910
Sorry, Japan Only!

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:23.500
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:26.290
"Dia and the Little
Flower Sprout."

00:07:36.130 --> 00:07:37.360
Su, hurry!

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:38.120
Okay!

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:40.380
Hey, Dia!

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:41.970
You wanna play tag too, Dia?

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:43.900
Here comes It!

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:49.300
Wait right there!

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:01.760
I wonder what kind of
flower will bloom?

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:32.690
Wow...

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:52.680
How pretty...

00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:57.850
This thing's in my way!

00:08:57.850 --> 00:08:59.200
Take this, and that!

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:00.630
Cease that at once.

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:05.310
You should cherish the
flowers and the trees.

00:09:06.530 --> 00:09:07.710
It's a tree monster!

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:09.400
I'm sorry!

00:09:11.790 --> 00:09:13.390
Thank you.

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:24.800
What's with Dia?

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:26.580
She fell asleep here?

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:30.890
It's nice weather out, so perhaps she
fell asleep under the warm sun.

00:09:30.890 --> 00:09:33.290
She looks like she's having
some fun dream.

00:09:33.290 --> 00:09:37.170
I'd feel bad about waking her,
so let's play over there.

00:09:37.170 --> 00:09:38.450
Yeah.

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:39.300
Yes.

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:47.020
See you again!

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:51.230
Coming up next is Shugo
Chara Dokki Doki!

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:54.150
Today's episode is
"Utau's Wavering Heart".

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:56.210
We might get to see...

00:09:56.210 --> 00:09:57.690
...Utau-chan's Character
Transformation!

00:09:57.690 --> 00:09:58.960
Coming up next!

00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:13.140
I'm sure I can be a different person than I was yesterday

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:17.970
with a hop, step, and a jump!

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:27.820
Since I met you I've been in a tizzy every day.

00:10:27.820 --> 00:10:33.350
Laughing, getting angry, going
crazy... It's been tough!

00:10:33.350 --> 00:10:38.650
Since I was able to see you, I've been excited every day.

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:43.500
Even slipping and falling, I've been having fun!

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:51.480
Now that I think about it, I haven't had a chance to tell you.

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:57.290
I have something to say.

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:03.230
Thank you, I'm so grateful!

00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:09.580
I might not be saying it right, but it comes from my heart.

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:14.090
Thank you, for everything!

00:11:14.090 --> 00:11:21.660
It's all thanks to you that I can be honest and say it.

00:11:44.590 --> 00:11:46.750
Miss "Star" sure is
full of herself.

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:48.760
Utau-chan can be
quite stubborn.

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:52.640
Utau-chan, I think you should
go back right away.

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:55.240
19 - Utau's
Wavering Heart

00:11:52.640 --> 00:11:55.240
Even if I go back, my
mind hasn't changed.

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:57.910
I have no intention of
changing how I sing.

00:11:57.910 --> 00:12:00.230
That's right! There's no way
you're wrong, Utau!

00:12:00.230 --> 00:12:01.430
But...

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:02.420
Shuddap!

00:12:04.310 --> 00:12:07.490
Oh, help me... God damn...

00:12:08.350 --> 00:12:09.680
Serves you right!

00:12:16.640 --> 00:12:17.590
Here ya go!

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:22.330
They changed the flavor!

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:26.100
They took customer feedback
and changed their recipe.

00:12:27.420 --> 00:12:31.970
They lightened up the flavor from the
heavy base to appeal more to women.

00:12:33.430 --> 00:12:35.210
Changing just 'cause people
will accept it better?

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:36.360
What's with that?

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:38.400
Did this shop sell its pride?

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:42.280
Well, it tastes good
so why not?

00:12:42.930 --> 00:12:44.150
This is delicious.

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:46.950
It's light and easy to eat.

00:12:49.650 --> 00:12:50.670
I won't accept it.

00:12:52.140 --> 00:12:53.450
Something bad happen?

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:54.990
You seem irritated
about something.

00:12:54.990 --> 00:12:56.400
I am not irritated!

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:04.840
At times like this, wouldn't eating something
sweet with a female friend help change your mood?

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:09.260
Oh wait, you don't have
any female friends!

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:13.180
Yes I do.

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:16.020
What? Why?

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:19.190
I just... happened to
be passing by...

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.400
Utau-chan?

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:21.470
It's Utau-chan!

00:13:21.470 --> 00:13:23.070
Utau-chan!

00:13:23.850 --> 00:13:25.580
Wait just a second, Utau is...

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:27.440
Utau-chan came
to our house...

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:28.860
It's like a dream!

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:30.150
Um, you see...

00:13:30.150 --> 00:13:34.030
I can, um, sing all of your
songs, Utau-chan!

00:13:34.030 --> 00:13:36.000
Love Sunshine...

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:37.820
Super cute!

00:13:40.780 --> 00:13:42.520
Oh right! We have cake!

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:44.320
Or maybe we should
order sushi!

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:45.690
Ah, that's my cell.

00:13:45.690 --> 00:13:47.960
Hello, Chief?

00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:49.640
Um, Utau-chan...
Can I take your picture?

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:51.510
Sing us a song!

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:53.630
Please, quit it already!

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:55.600
No, I will not quit.

00:13:57.040 --> 00:14:01.040
I know it's difficult, but this project
is very important to me.

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:07.280
Yes, yes... I'll take full responsibility.
I promise you it'll be really fascinating.

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:10.210
Yes, of course.

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:19.730
Sorry about that...
My family's got no class.

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:22.010
Your mother is impressive.

00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:24.070
You think?

00:14:24.070 --> 00:14:27.140
I can tell she has a lot
of pride in her work.

00:14:27.140 --> 00:14:29.790
She can be quite stubborn
about it, though.

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:32.950
She's had times when she acted like
that and fought with her bosses.

00:14:32.950 --> 00:14:34.430
And so what?

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:39.170
It doesn't matter who it is, I'm not
going to bend myself to them!

00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:40.240
Sorry...

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:41.710
Why are <i>you</i> apologizing?

00:14:41.710 --> 00:14:45.050
Well, you just seemed
kind of angry, so...

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:48.110
I'm not really angry...

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:54.440
I cannot. I want to sing
the way I always have.

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:01.680
So this is as far as Hoshina
Utau goes, huh?

00:15:02.870 --> 00:15:05.860
Fine then, do it how
you want to.

00:15:06.370 --> 00:15:07.870
Too bad, though.

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:11.800
I thought you might have
gone a bit farther...

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:23.260
Utau?

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:25.690
It's nothing...

00:15:26.210 --> 00:15:29.470
You were passing by...
So, not working today?

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:32.150
I'm working. Recording
my new song.

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:35.970
Work? Oh I see, you're
taking a breather.

00:15:37.150 --> 00:15:40.380
Recording a new song
must be tough.

00:15:41.270 --> 00:15:44.510
Giving birth to something
new is always a struggle.

00:15:44.510 --> 00:15:46.220
It's the same with cooking!

00:15:46.220 --> 00:15:47.800
And sports!

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:49.220
What kind of song
is it this time?

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:52.970
It's a song as cool as all the others!

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:55.370
I can't wait!

00:15:56.840 --> 00:15:58.310
Good for you, Utau.

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:05.180
You're able to move your millions of fans
across the country through your music.

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:09.010
Move them?

00:16:09.010 --> 00:16:10.190
I hope so...

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:14.150
What are you talking about?
Of course you will!

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:17.510
Do you remember that
girl named Rikka?

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:21.700
I bet she's totally looking forward
to your new song!

00:16:22.450 --> 00:16:23.540
I see...

00:16:25.700 --> 00:16:28.150
And not just Rikka, either.

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:34.410
All the fans, here in town and around the country,
are eagerly awaiting your new song, Utau!

00:16:35.730 --> 00:16:36.930
I...

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:39.560
I think you're really
amazing, Utau.

00:16:42.860 --> 00:16:44.540
Everyone, it's an X egg!

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:00.370
Ran!

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:01.030
Okay!

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:05.410
My heart: Unlock!

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:22.090
Character Transformation:
Amulet Heart!

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:27.100
I don't wanna!

00:17:30.700 --> 00:17:32.080
Utau, let's go!

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:32.770
R-Right...

00:17:33.920 --> 00:17:36.240
My heart: Unlock!

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:52.260
Character Transformation:
Lunatic Charm!

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:59.300
I don't wanna!

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:02.170
Nightmare Lorelei!

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:08.350
I don't wanna!

00:18:15.470 --> 00:18:17.000
What are you whining
on about?

00:18:18.390 --> 00:18:22.120
If you just run away from something you don't
wanna do, you'll never get anywhere!

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:23.870
Blast through it!

00:18:32.140 --> 00:18:33.680
Utau's right!

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:36.650
Just try it once!

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:43.010
Even if you don't want to, if you try it once you
might find out it works better than you thought!

00:18:46.110 --> 00:18:48.290
Smile, and try it!

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:51.090
If at first you don't succeed,
try, try again!

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:59.440
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:19:01.520 --> 00:19:03.190
Open Heart!

00:19:14.600 --> 00:19:17.490
You don't have a care
in the world, do you?

00:19:17.490 --> 00:19:19.290
Huh? What are you
talking about?

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:23.090
Thank you.

00:19:24.210 --> 00:19:25.550
What did you just say?

00:19:27.750 --> 00:19:28.620
Nothing.

00:19:29.260 --> 00:19:31.020
Utau-chan!

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:31.840
El!

00:19:31.840 --> 00:19:33.640
I finally found you.

00:19:34.370 --> 00:19:35.630
I'm returning to the studio.

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:37.570
Until next time.

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:41.690
Right. See you again.

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:46.930
It looks like Utau-chan
feels better.

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:47.770
Yeah.

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:52.500
I apologize for letting my emotions
get the better of me before.

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:54.600
Utau-chan...

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:56.710
Please let me try again.

00:20:01.350 --> 00:20:02.140
Okay.

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:03.720
Then, let's begin.

00:20:04.980 --> 00:20:07.890
All your fans are also
waiting for this song.

00:20:09.760 --> 00:20:11.650
Yes. Of course.

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:15.540
Thank goodness, Utau-chan!

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:17.690
You feel better just from being
together with her...

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:18.930
Almost like you're...

00:20:18.930 --> 00:20:20.250
Best friends!

00:20:25.230 --> 00:20:33.040
Follow, alone, this nostalgic road

00:20:34.760 --> 00:20:42.270
That day in my childhood,
holding hands

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:48.250
Pastel paint colored memories

00:20:48.250 --> 00:20:52.940
Painting the weight of time

00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:58.790
Small, red shoes

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:03.620
Chased after your
broad back...

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:13.740
The crimson sky enveloping
our two shadows.

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:32.420
Guardian Egg Fortune Telling!

00:21:33.720 --> 00:21:36.590
Choose one of the four eggs!

00:21:38.630 --> 00:21:40.760
Which egg will be
the lucky one?

00:21:44.940 --> 00:21:46.910
Guardian Egg Friendship Fortune!

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:49.670
First, for those of you
who chose Su's egg...

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:52.270
Four Shugoluck stars,
Super Lucky!

00:21:52.270 --> 00:21:55.480
You might learn something
good from your friends!

00:21:55.480 --> 00:21:57.540
Don't forget to pay
back the favor!

00:21:58.530 --> 00:22:00.400
Dia's egg is three Shugoluck stars.

00:22:00.400 --> 00:22:03.120
Talk about your problems
with your friends!

00:22:00.400 --> 00:22:03.120
Guardian Egg Friendship Fortune

00:22:03.120 --> 00:22:04.910
Ran's egg is two Shugoluck stars.

00:22:04.910 --> 00:22:07.710
Fix a small misunderstanding
with a letter!

00:22:08.400 --> 00:22:10.540
Finally, for those of you
who chose Miki's egg...

00:22:10.540 --> 00:22:14.240
Aww darn, one Shugoluck star...

00:22:14.240 --> 00:22:18.190
You might get hung up over something trivial
and get in a fight with your friends!

00:22:18.190 --> 00:22:21.940
If you think that's happening, stop
and apologize right away, okay?

00:22:18.190 --> 00:22:23.860
Lucky Item: A Brand New Eraser

00:22:24.670 --> 00:22:26.360
Wasn't today a lot of fun?

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:28.720
See you for the next
Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:28.720 --> 00:22:32.170
Lock On: Open Heart!

00:22:32.170 --> 00:22:33.830
Bye-bye!

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:05.040
Now's the time to make your move.

00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:09.690
Nothing will start if you start worrying.

00:23:09.690 --> 00:23:12.110
A song to your lips!

00:23:12.110 --> 00:23:15.830
Yeah! What're you waiting for?

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:18.610
Bang on this door to the world.

00:23:18.610 --> 00:23:22.490
On whose terms?  That's right, ours!

00:23:22.490 --> 00:23:28.020
Just trying to grasp success before you,

00:23:28.020 --> 00:23:33.590
you're sure to become lost in the labyrinth.

00:23:35.380 --> 00:23:40.670
Embrace the melody in your heart!

00:23:40.670 --> 00:23:45.830
Try singing it, try shouting it!

00:23:45.830 --> 00:23:56.640
Each time you get closer to who you
want to be, they'll be given birth:

00:23:56.640 --> 00:23:59.260
Our Songs!

00:24:04.920 --> 00:24:19.850
Sorry, Japan Only!

00:24:06.010 --> 00:24:11.880
We'll give 10 copies of the Shugo Chara Character Song
Collection 3 CD signed by Itou-san as presents!

00:24:12.910 --> 00:24:16.090
Please send in completed
postcards to enter!

00:24:16.090 --> 00:24:17.650
We'll be waiting for them!
